    "meet_the_boys": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "data": {
        "npc_template": "npc_02_mike_wheeler",
        "dialog_set": "main",
        "npc_name": "迈克·威勒",
        "lines": [
          "威尔失踪了，我们必须找到他！",
          "我们昨晚在树林里看到了一些奇怪的东西...",
          "我们应该先去警局，看看霍珀警长有没有什么新消息。"
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ask_about_will",
            "text": "你们最后一次见到威尔是在哪？"
          },
          {
            "id": "ask_about_monster",
            "text": "你们看到的奇怪东西到底是什么？"
          },
          {
            "id": "go_to_police",
            "text": "走吧，带我去见警长。"
          }
        ],
        "voiceover": "stranger_things_hawkins/meet_the_boys_voice",
        "profile_id": "mike"
      },
      "on_enter": [],
      "edges": [
        {
          "target": "boys_answer_will",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "DIALOGUE_CHOICE",
              "value": "ask_about_will"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "boys_answer_monster",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "DIALOGUE_CHOICE",
              "value": "ask_about_monster"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "find_hopper",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "DIALOGUE_CHOICE",
              "value": "go_to_police"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "boys_answer_will": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "data": {
        "npc_template": "npc_02_mike_wheeler",
        "npc_name": "迈克·威勒",
        "lines": [
          "就在那个名为'幽暗密林'的弯道附近，就在警长找到他自行车的地方。",
          "他本该在回家的路上，但他根本没到家。"
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "go_to_police",
            "text": "好的，我们现在就去警局。"
          }
        ],
        "profile_id": "mike",
        "voiceover": "stranger_things_hawkins/boys_answer_will_voice"
      },
      "edges": [
        {
          "target": "find_hopper",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "DIALOGUE_CHOICE",
              "value": "go_to_police"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "boys_answer_monster": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "data": {
        "npc_template": "npc_03_dustin_henderson",
        "npc_name": "达斯汀·亨德森",
        "lines": [
          "它很大，没有脸... 几乎看起来不像人类。",
          "我们只是匆匆一瞥，然后大家都逃跑了。"
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "go_to_police",
            "text": "太可怕了，我们要去警局把这个告诉霍珀。"
          }
        ],
        "profile_id": "dustin",
        "voiceover": "stranger_things_hawkins/boys_answer_monster_voice"
      },
      "edges": [
        {
          "target": "find_hopper",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "DIALOGUE_CHOICE",
              "value": "go_to_police"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
